<body>
    <h1>Convert to Voice</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"contentLayout2">
<style>[data-colorid=3Dhjl4ghkjnl]{color:#ff5630} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Dhjl4ghkjnl]{color:#cf2600}[data-colorid=3Doddsfz02w3]{c=
olor:#ff5630} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Doddsfz02w3]{colo=
r:#cf2600}[data-colorid=3Ddto10vf57y]{color:#ff5630} html[data-color-mode=
=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Ddto10vf57y]{color:#cf2600}</style>
<div class=3D"columnLayout fixed-width" data-layout=3D"fixed-width">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p>The =E2=80=9CConvert to Voice=E2=80=9D panel dials a supplied number for=
 a customer. Once the call is answered, the customer interaction proceeds t=
hrough the Logic flow as a voice interaction, effectively converting from a=
ny previous interaction type.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wr=
apper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"c=
onfluence-embedded-image image-center" width=3D"274" loading=3D"lazy" src=
=3D"5bac95d7018e13d39bac72386e20d1acd77a93b3a899c35c940a7d32cc985656" data-=
image-src=3D"https://sharpencx.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/4243=
914753/Screenshot%202024-10-29%20at%207.10.35%E2%80%AFAM.png?version=3D1&am=
p;modificationDate=3D1730211072652&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-=
height=3D"165" data-width=3D"430" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-=
linked-resource-id=3D"4243456002" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-l=
inked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Sc=
reenshot 2024-10-29 at 7.10.35=E2=80=AFAM.png" data-base-url=3D"https://sha=
rpencx.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/png" =
data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"4243914753" data-linked-resource-conta=
iner-version=3D"1" data-media-id=3D"a52d1ad2-966f-4dfa-bae7-195284e8730f" d=
ata-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"105"></span>
<h3 id=3D"ConverttoVoice-Usingthispanel">Using this panel</h3>
<p>This panel helps you address scenarios where switching to a voice call w=
ould be more desired or effective than the current type of interaction. The=
 panel also makes this switch convenient for customers, bringing it to them=
 and maintaining engagement instead of forcing customers to disengage to fi=
nd what they need.</p>
<p>For example, if a customer enters a Logic flow via SMS but conveys a nee=
d that you determine requires human interaction, the Convert to Voice panel=
 can start a voice call with the customer without ending the Logic flow. Th=
e customer can continue the interaction seamlessly as a result.</p>
<h3 id=3D"ConverttoVoice-Configuration">Configuration</h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"columnLayout two-equal" data-layout=3D"two-equal">
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Name: <span data-colorid=3D"hjl4ghkjnl"> </span></strong>E=
nter a unique name to identify the panel.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Set as Flow Initiator:</strong> Select this button to set the pa=
nel as the starting point (i.e., the flow initiator) of the Logic flow. Onc=
e set, this can only be removed by setting a different panel as the flow in=
itiator.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Panel Description:</strong> Enter notes about the panel for refe=
rence here. This field is collapsed by default. Select the down arrow to ex=
pand.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>To Number:</strong> <strong><span data-colorid=3D"oddsfz02w3"> <=
/span></strong>Enter the number to be called. Accepted number formats inclu=
de <code>+1XXXYYYZZZZ</code> and <code>XXXYYYZZZZ</code>.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>From Number:</strong> <strong><span data-colorid=3D"dto10vf57y">=
 </span></strong>Choose an originating phone number for the call by either =
using the dropdown menu (default) or entering a variable:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><em><strong>Use Dropdown:</strong></em> Select an option from the dropdo=
wn menu. All 10-digit phone numbers available to your company's Sharpen acc=
ount will appear here.</p></li>
<li>
<p><em><strong>Use Variable:</strong></em> Enter a variable that contains a=
 phone number available for use in the Sharpen platform. Accepted number fo=
rmats include <code>+1XXXYYYZZZZ</code> and <code>XXXYYYZZZZ</code>.</p></l=
i>
</ol></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exit Paths:</strong> Use the dropdown menu to select another pan=
el in your flow. Any output from this panel will advance to the linked pane=
l.</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Default:</strong> The Default path is taken upon panel execution=
.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Already Voice:</strong> Select an exit path to take if an incomi=
ng interaction is already a voice call. In this scenario, the panel does no=
t place a call.</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Error: </strong>The path taken when there is an error</p></li>
</ol></li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"cell normal" data-type=3D"normal">
<div class=3D"innerCell">
<p></p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper=
 confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image i=
mage-center" width=3D"313" loading=3D"lazy" src=3D"0820f183bb145688f6187757=
e1dec3c137abd12addf641e5841fb7fda9ec5fc5" data-image-src=3D"https://sharpen=
